", "text": "J.M.W. Turner, Snow Storm – Steam-Boat off a Harbour's Mouth, c.1842. The crossing as vortex."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "J. M. W. Turner · Public domain · via Wikimedia Commons"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Source: "}, {"type": "text", "text": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:J.M.W._Turner_%E2%80%93_Snow_Storm_-_Steam-Boat_off_a_Harbour%27s_Mouth.jpg", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:J.M.W._Turner_%E2%80%93_Snow_Storm_-_Steam-Boat_off_a_Harbour%27s_Mouth.jpg", "target": "_blank", "rel": "noopener noreferrer nofollow", "class": null}}]}]}]}, "scale": 1, "autoSize": false}, "meta": {}}, {"id": "shape:rVCYjgv2keUfPfpP2zBbv", "typeName": "shape", "type": "image", "x": 980.0, "y": 60.0, "rotation": 0, "index": "b2V", "parentId": "shape:k8keCbDz7z0WKosEyOFuL", "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "props": {"w": 420.0, "h": 277.5, "playing": true, "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:James_McNeill_Whistler_-_Nocturne,_Blue_and_Gold%E2%80%94Southampton_Water_-_1900.52_-_Art_Institute_of_Chicago.jpg", "assetId": "asset:Z5tQQ0JrpHi13pRPhWVsg", "crop": null, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "altText": "James McNeill Whistler, Nocturne: Blue and Gold—Southampton Water, 1872 (Art Institute of Chicago). Ships reduced to points of amber in blue fog."}, "meta": {}}, {"id": "shape:pWSWGRhxsrTnur1NDx56B", "typeName": "shape", "type": "text", "x": 980.0, "y": 345.5, "rotation": 0, "index": "b2W", "parentId": "shape:k8keCbDz7z0WKosEyOFuL", "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "props": {"color": "black", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "w": 420.0, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "James McNeill Whistler, Nocturne: Blue and Gold—Southampton Water, 1872 (Art Institute of Chicago). Ships reduced to points of amber in blue fog."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "conte